{
  "description": "Relay routing: binary frame \"HR\" (0x48 0x52) ‖ ver 0x01 ‖ op 0x01 (forward) ‖ device_id (16 bytes: the destination in a frame a device sends, the source in a frame the relay delivers) ‖ the HL frame, intact. The relay only swaps the device_id; text frames {\"to\", \"env\"} become {\"from\", \"env\"} with env byte for byte as received, and a from sent by the device is ignored. The relay checks only the HR header and that an HL frame follows, never the HL frame itself. Invalid vectors: what the relay refuses, with the relay error it answers.",
